// In Code Builder open the Command Palette and run this script:
// > SFDX: Create Query in SOQL Builder
// Create a query that selects the Id, Subject, Status, and IsClosed fields from the Case sObject retrieving only Closed records.
// Save your query as a file called Task1.soql in the /scripts/soql folder.

SELECT Id, Subject, Status, IsClosed
FROM Case


